u, Nepal\n					</li>\n				                   	</ul>\n	                    \n					\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n	\r\n	\r\n    \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n            	\r\n\r\n	            	\r\n\r\n		                \n	<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/\">\n\n    	\n        	<img src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-46edffd1ec57645e.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n\n        	\n    </a>\n\n	<ul><li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/about-dr-rajan-tajhyas-skin-clinic/\">About</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/\">Our Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/package-price/\">Package &amp; Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\n\n		    <li>\n		    	    	\n	<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/book-an-appointment/\">\n		Get Appointment	</a>\n        \n    		    </li>\n\n	    	</ul>\r\n		                \r\n		                				            	\r\n		            	\r\n\r\n		            \r\n\r\n		        \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n               \r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n\r\n		\n						\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n									\n					\n				\n										<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/laser-hair-reduction/\">LASER HAIR REMOVALLearn More</a><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/hydra-facial/\">Hydra FacialLearn More</a>				\n															\n													\n						\n													\n																\n												\n				\n								\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n							\n			\n		\n						\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n															<img width=\"1066\" height=\"1600\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-c27addb39f27bded.png\" alt=\"Dr.Rajan Tajhya Md Dermatology\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-c27addb39f27bded.png 1066w, http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-7385c13bf84e7e70.png 200w, http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-9b2c5b16e07f6f57.png 682w, http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-a6fe7c29e7195036.png 768w, http://localhost:8000/storage/pages/home-copy-02e0d990d70025df.png 1023w\">															\n				\n					\n		\n				\n			\n						\n				\n					<h2>Dr. Rajan Tajhya\'s skin   clinic</h2>				\n				\n				\n				\n							\n			\n							\n					\n						\n		\n						\n				\n				\n				\n					<p>Dr. Rajan Tajhya\'s skin   clinic is located in Pulchowk, Damkal Chowk, Latitpur. We have been giving our services since 2012 A.D. We believe in treatment thru technology with the art of science to redefine your skin. When it comes to treatment with machine, lasers and technology, it has always been most expensive and unaffordable to normal Nepalese people. We have made our services the most affordable with the world class FDA approved lasers &amp; anti aging treatments. We have FDA approved Diode, IPL, ND:yag lasers and anti aging treatment like, High Intensity  Focused Ultrasound (HIFU), Microneedling, Radio  Frequency, Hydrafacial with botox &amp; fillers.</p>Dr. Rajan Babu Tajhya is a board certified dermatologist specialized in laser and cosmetic surgery. He has completed his M.B.B.S. from Kathmandu University and Specialized Dermatology from Tribhuwan University at the year 2010 A.D. Dr. Rajan Babu Tajhya keeps himself updated in the latest treatment procedures available in Dermatology. He has a calm personality and ethical treatment method. Combining the modern way of technology with his art of surgery and laser treatments gives the best skin care solution.				\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n							\n			\n		\n						\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n					<h2>Our Services</h2>				\n				\n				\n				\n					<h3>A Wide Range Of Services</h3>				\n				\n				\n				\n							\n			\n							\n					\n						\n		\n						\n				\n				\n				\n							\n			\n		\n						\n				\n				\n						\n					\n			\