linic.com/package-price/\">Price</a> starts from the range of 2500 and its range may vary according to its size, color, and space occupied.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Does it leave a scar?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>After the ink gets removed,  <a href=\"https://akarshanskin.com/our-services/tattoo-removal-nepal/\">It</a> leaves a shadow that may fade with time.</p>\n\r\n				\r\n\r\n			\r\n\r\n		\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n	\n\n	    \n\n	    			    	\n			        <ul><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Drrajantajhyaskinclinic\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dr.rajan.skin.laser/\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-rajan-tajhya-427924283/?originalSubdomain=np\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@drrajantajhyasskinlasercli2463\"></a></li></ul>		        \n		        \n	        <ul><li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/about-dr-rajan-tajhyas-skin-clinic/\">About</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-dermatologist-nepal-dr-rajan-babu-tajhya/\">Best Dermatologist in Nepal: Expert Skin Care with Dr. Rajan Babu Tajhya</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/book-an-appointment/\">Book An Appointment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-skin-doctor-nepal-dr-rajan-tajhya-advanced-dermatology/\">Find the Best Skin Doctor in Nepal: Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s Advanced Dermatology Clinic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-skin-doctor-advanced-dermatology-treatments/\">Find the Best Skin Doctor: Advanced Dermatology Treatment &amp; Skin Care Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/home-copy/\">Home – Copy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/\">Our Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/package-price/\">Package &amp; Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajan