(9, 'Acne and Acne Scar Removal - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology', 'acne-and-acne-scar-removal', 'skin', 'skin', 'services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-270d6faea216df9d.png', 'Explore acne and acne scar treatments in Nepal. At Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s clinic. Get expert advice for healthier skin!', '<div><!-- primary start -->\r\n\r\n						\n<article>\n\n	<div>\n\n		<img width=\"640\" height=\"229\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-270d6faea216df9d.png\" alt=\"Acne and Acne Scar Removal\" title=\"Acne and Acne Scar Removal\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-270d6faea216df9d.png 1024w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-71928f811a2797e8.png 300w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-ffb11c270d3055e9.png 768w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-f7ea1c518c0494eb.png 1120w\">\n		<header>\n			<h3>Acne and Acne Scar Removal</h3>		</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n		\r\n<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"366\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-270d6faea216df9d.png\" alt=\"acne and acne scar treatment\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-270d6faea216df9d.png 1024w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-71928f811a2797e8.png 300w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-ffb11c270d3055e9.png 768w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/acne-and-acne-scar-removal-f7ea1c518c0494eb.png 1120w\"></figure>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>In Nepal, we often know acne as pimples. Acne is formed when the hair pores on  the skin become plugged with oil and dead skin cells. This is the perfect place for bacteria to grow and create red bumps and pus-filled red bumps known as acne.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Acne can sometimes leave long-lasting marks called acne scars.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Scars that occur after acne is acne scar, which can range from mild hyperpigmented dark marks to deep ugly scars.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Are all acne scars the same?</h2>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>All acne scars are not the same. Each type responds to treatment procedures differently.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>This is why it is important to know their types and know what kind of scar you have. But most people always have mixed types of scar.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h4>a) Raised scar</h4>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>This type of scar is also called hypertrophic scars.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Unlike other kinds of acne scars that are depressed, raised hypertrophic scars are thick, lumpy formations that are raised than the normal skin surface.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Raised scars are seen more in the chest and back than on the face. They are formed by the over-production of collagen during acne healing.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h4>b) Depressed scar</h4>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>They are also called atrophic scars. They are relatively flat, thin scars. Depressed scars look sunken below the normal skin, hence creating an uneven skin surface.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Depressed scars are formed when enough collagen is not formed during acne healing.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>These are the types of depressed scars:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Boxcar</h3>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Boxcar refers to scars with broad depressions and sharply defined edges. They are generally deep and U-shaped. However, the shallower (less deep) they are, the better they respond to acne scar removal treatments.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Ice pick</h3>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>These are deep, narrow pitted scars. Ice picks are generally V-shaped and are the hardest to deal with because they can go deeper into the skin during formation.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Rolling</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>These are also depressed scars with sloping edges. They are rolling with rounded edges and irregular appearance.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Notice the small depressions caused on his cheek because of acne.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Treatment of acne during the initial days of acne eruption heals without any treatment and leaves no scar. In some cases, acne occurs time and again and when not treated well leaves a scar. Timely treatment of acne is necessary to prevent acne scars.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>When the acne gets old and reoccurs frequently chances of causing scars also increase. Besides these environmental factors, psychological factors, hormonal factors, and other comorbid conditions also play a vital role.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>There are numerous treatment procedures available to minimize/remove acne scars.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>However, you need to understand that the basic working principle is the same for all the procedures. </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Basically, all kinds of treatment focus on stimulating the production of collagen and/or elastin. Collagen and elastin are two substances that will work against acne scars. They will work on the tissue that is deformed by the acne scars and will make them almost like normal human skin. </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>This process is called Collagen Induction Therapy. </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>At <b>Dr.Rajan Tajhya’s skin laser clinic</b>, we have the following treatments for you:</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>a) <a href=\"https://akarshanskin.com/our-services/prp-micro-needle-therapy/\">PRP for acne scar treatment</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>b) Microneedling with disposable needles</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>c) Fillers</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>d) TCA Cross Method</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>e) Subcision</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>f) Surgery</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>g) Microneedling Radiofrequency</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>h) Co2 fractional lasers</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Rajan Babu Tajhya is a board-certified dermatologist and laser specialist. He completed his M.B.B.S. from Kathmandu University and Specialized Dermatology from Tribhuwan University in the year 2010 A.D.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>We offer free of cost consultation by an expert <a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/skin-and-dermatology-consultation/\">skin</a> doctor. You can clear your queries and learn more about ways to ensure a healthier skin-life.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2><b>What is the price of Acne Scar Removal Treatment in Nepal </b></h2>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>1) Microneedling: Rs. 4000<br>2) Microneedling + PRP: Rs. 6000<br>3) Microneedling + Subcision: Rs. 7000<br>4) Only Subcision: Rs. 5000<br>5) TCA Cross Peel: Rs. 3000<br>(Free in-between sessions)</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Package for 8 months, 8 sessions: Rs. 42,000</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>*Kindly expect realistic results.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n	</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n	</article><!-- #post-2737 -->\n\r\n					</div>', 'Acne and Acne Scar Removal - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology | Dr. Rajan Tajhya Skin Clinic', 'Explore acne and acne scar treatments in Nepal. At Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s clinic. Get expert advice for healthier skin!', 0, 1, 24, '2026-09-19 01:54:44', '2026-10-03 11:10:15');
INSERT INTO `services` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `category`, `icon`, `image`, `short_description`, `full_description`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `is_featured`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(10, 'Skin and Dermatology Consultation - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology', 'skin-and-dermatology-consultation', 'skin', 'skin', 'services/skin-and-dermatology-consultation-46edffd1ec57645e.png', 'At Dr. Rajan Tajhya&#039;s Skin Laser Clinic, we offer expert solutions for skin issues, including psoriasis, acne, and mole removal.', '<div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n	<a href=\"#content\">\r\n		Skip to content		\r\n	</a>\r\n\r\n	\n	\n		\n			\n				\n					\n\n						\n		\n\n			<ul>\n				\n				 	<li>\n						<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Drrajantajhyaskinclinic\">\n							\n								\n							\n							\n								Facebook							\n						</a>\n					</li>	\n					\n						#top-social-left li:hover a.social_links_header_0,\n						#top-social-left li:focus a.social_links_header_0 {\n						    background: #3b5998;\n						}\n					\n\n				 	\n				 	<li>\n						<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dr.rajan.skin.laser/\">\n							\n								\n							\n							\n								Instagram							\n						</a>\n					</li>	\n					\n						#top-social-left li:hover a.social_links_header_1,\n						#top-social-left li:focus a.social_links_header_1 {\n						    background: #00acee;\n						}\n					\n\n				 	\n				 	<li>\n						<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-rajan-tajhya-427924283/?originalSubdomain=np\">\n							\n								\n							\n							\n								Linkedin							\n						</a>\n					</li>	\n					\n						#top-social-left li:hover a.social_links_header_2,\n						#top-social-left li:focus a.social_links_header_2 {\n						    background: #ea3a7e;\n						}\n					\n\n				 	\n				 	<li>\n						<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@drrajantajhyasskinlasercli2463\">\n							\n								\n							\n							\n								Youtube							\n						</a>\n					</li>	\n					\n						#top-social-left li:hover a.social_links_header_3,\n						#top-social-left li:focus a.social_links_header_3 {\n						    background: #cd201f;\n						}\n					\n\n				 									\n			\n			</ul>\n\n		\n\n		\n					\n					\n						\n		                   	<ul>	                   		\n		                   				<li>\n				\n\n				 +977 9813903982\n						\n		</li>\n				<li>\n			\n				 dr.rajantajhyaskinclinic@gmail.com\n				\n		</li>\n				<li>\n						\n				 Kathmandu, Nepal\n					</li>\n				                   	</ul>\n	                    \n					\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n	\r\n	\r\n    \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n            	\r\n\r\n	            	\r\n\r\n		                \n	<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/\">\n\n    	\n        	<img src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/skin-and-dermatology-consultation-46edffd1ec57645e.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n\n        	\n    </a>\n\n	<ul><li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/about-dr-rajan-tajhyas-skin-clinic/\">About</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/\">Our Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/package-price/\">Package &amp; Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\n\n		    <li>\n		    	    	\n	<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/book-an-appointment/\">\n		Get Appointment	</a>\n        \n    		    </li>\n\n	    	</ul>\r\n		                \r\n		                				            	\r\n		            	\r\n\r\n		            \r\n\r\n		        \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n               \r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n		\r\n\r\n			\r\n\r\n				\r\n\r\n							\n						\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n									\n					\n				\n														\n							\n				\n								\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n						\n					\n			\n						\n				\n									<p>At Dr.Rajan Tajhya’s skin laser clinic. We offer a complete solution to your skin problems. </p><p>We are specialized in treating even the scariest of skin issues, like psoriasis, melasma, acne, hair fall, dermatitis, warts, moles, and fungal infection. </p><p>Furthermore, the treatment providers at At  Dr.Rajan Tajhya’s clinic are also specialized in diagnosing and treating various sexually transmitted diseases that show symptoms mainly in the skin. </p><h2>1. Mole removal</h2><p>The procedure for mole removal depends on the size of the mole and the color of the skin. If it is a bigger mole, we might have to do cosmetic surgery. Meanwhile, smaller moles can be removed by cautery laser and pen.</p><h2>2. Freckles removal<br>3. Wart/ Skin tag/ Corn removal</h2><p>Skin warts: Warts are skin growths that are caused by the human papillomavirus (HPV).</p><p>Skin tag: Skin tags are painless, noncancerous growths on the skin. They’re connected to the skin by a small, thin stalk called a peduncle. Skin tags are common in both men and women, especially after age 50. They can appear anywhere on your body, though they’re commonly found in places where your skin folds such as the neck and armpits.</p><p>Skin corn: Corns and calluses are thick, hardened layers of skin that develop when your skin tries to protect itself against friction and pressure. They most often develop on the feet and toes or hands and fingers. They are usually caused by bad shoes, uncomfortable soles, etc.</p><p>All these skin complications can be treated by an experienced dermatologist in our clinic.</p><h2>4. Skin cancer surgery</h2><p>Unwanted lesions in the skin can be an indication of skin cancer. In order to confirm whether the unwanted growth in your skin is cancerous (or not), we perform a detailed biopsy and send the Histology for confirmation.</p><p>The marks left by such incidences may be removed in our clinic.</p><h2>5.Treatment of Genital warts and other Sexually Transmitted Diseases</h2><p>Genital wart is the most common sexually transmitted disease. Genital warts are soft growths that appear on the genitals. They can cause pain, discomfort, and itching. Genital warts are caused by the human papillomavirus (HPV). In fact, HPV is so common that the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)Trusted Source says that most sexually active people get it at some point. However, the virus doesn’t always lead to complications such as genital warts. In fact, in most cases, the virus goes away on its own without causing any health problems.</p><p>Genital warts affect both women and men, but women are more vulnerable to complications. First, we need to confirm the actual occurrence of the STD before we start with the procedure. The condition is then treated with topical wart treatments like imiquimod (Aldara), podophyllin, and podofilox (Condylox) trichloroacetic acid, or TCA.</p><p>Other sexually transmitted diseases like Syphilis, Gonorrhoea, Discharges, etc. are also treated at our clinic.</p><p>Our treatment provider is male.</p><h2>6. Issues related to male sexual health and wellbeing</h2><h2>7. Treatment of skin conditions like fungal infections, allergies, drug reactions</h2><h2>8. Nail and Hair treatment</h2><p>Nails: Nutritional deficiency, fungal infection, etc.</p><p>Hair: Hair fall problem (balding), removal of excess hair from the body parts.</p><h2>9. Cosmetic surgery</h2><h3>a) Asian Eyelid Surgery</h3><p>“All eyes are beautiful, let us enhance their beauty with technology.”</p><p>Most ladies use eyelid sticker to be able to put eyeliners while doing their makeup. With this one-hour procedure, the problem will be solved permanently.</p><p><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/asian-eyelid-surgery-or-blepharoplasty/\">Asian eyelid surgery</a> is one of the most common cosmetic procedures we perform in our clinic. The primary purpose is to create a space for Mongolian eyes so that they can put an eyeliner. As the name suggests, the surgery is mainly done by Mongolians or Asians to have fuller, bigger eyes.</p><h3>b) Hooded Eyelid Surgery</h3><p>Some people experience a downwards hood in their eyes for a lot of reasons, primarily with age. We recommend Hooded Eyelid Surgery to delay the natural process.</p><h3>c) Eye bag removal surgery</h3><p>We know you don’t want saggy skin under your eyes. Nobody does. Shaggy deposits of fat under the eyes make them look swollen, affecting the overall cosmetic appearance.</p><h3>d) Scar revision surgery</h3><p>For years, scars were seen as permanent things that one carried for eternity. With all the medical advancements of the 21st century, that statement is now partially false.</p><p>At our clinic, you can mask your scars under the supervision of a skilled treatment provider. Your scar will be reduced by 80-90% of its original size.</p><p>This is a very minute surgery and will be completed quickly under the skillful hands of our dermatologist. The cost of <a href=\"https://akarshanskin.com/our-services/scar-revision-surgery/\">scar reduction/ removal</a> depends on the size and depth of the scars. Smaller scars can be removed at a generous package of Rs. 5000 to Rs. 6000 per cm. Meanwhile, removal of relatively bigger scars cost anywhere between Rs. 3000 to Rs. 4000 per cm.</p><h3>e) Ear Lobe Repair</h3><p>Women tend to have shaggy ears due to years of wearing heavy ear ornaments. Some men also get shaggy ears with age. Such conditions can be corrected if needed with the Ear Lobe Repair treatment procedure.</p><h3>f) Dimple creation surgery</h3><p>Let us all agree on one thing: people with dimples look cute. For real.</p><p>If God did not gift you with one, cosmetics and modern science will.</p><h3>g) Mole removal surgery (for bigger moles)</h3><p>Moles that are relatively big in size need to be removed with surgery. The procedure should be carried out in a way that leaves as little scar as possible. This is why an experienced dermatologist is of utmost importance.</p>								\n				\n					\n		\n					\n		\n				\n		\r\n				\r\n\r\n			\r\n\r\n		\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n	\n\n	    \n\n	    			    	\n			        <ul><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Drrajantajhyaskinclinic\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dr.rajan.skin.laser/\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-rajan-tajhya-427924283/?originalSubdomain=np\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@drrajantajhyasskinlasercli2463\"></a></li></ul>		        \n		        \n	        <ul><li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/about-dr-rajan-tajhyas-skin-clinic/\">About</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-dermatologist-nepal-dr-rajan-babu-tajhya/\">Best Dermatologist in Nepal: Expert Skin Care with Dr. Rajan Babu Tajhya</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/book-an-appointment/\">Book An Appointment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-skin-doctor-nepal-dr-rajan-tajhya-advanced-dermatology/\">Find the Best Skin Doctor in Nepal: Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s Advanced Dermatology Clinic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/best-skin-doctor-advanced-dermatology-treatments/\">Find the Best Skin Doctor: Advanced Dermatology Treatment &amp; Skin Care Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/home-copy/\">Home – Copy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/\">Our Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/package-price/\">Package &amp; Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/top-dermatologist-in-nepal-advanced-skin-treatments/\">Top Dermatologist in Nepal: Advanced Skin Treatments by Dr. Rajan Tajhya</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n	        <p>\n	            Copyright ©2026 \n				\n		Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology\n		. All rights reserved. Design and Developed  by <a href=\"https://reverhub.com/\">Rever Hub Pvt. Ltd.</a>\n\n\n	    	        </p>\n	    \n	\n\n	\r\n\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			\n    	\n    		\n    		\n    	    	\n    			<a>\r\n				\r\n			</a>\r\n		\r\n	\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <a></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n{\"prefetch\":[{\"source\":\"document\",\"where\":{\"and\":[{\"href_matches\":\"/*\"},{\"not\":{\"href_matches\":[\"/wp-*.php\",\"/wp-admin/*\",\"/wp-