(11, 'Wrinkle Reduction - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology', 'wrinkle-reduction', 'skin', 'skin', 'services/wrinkle-reduction-18c69be1c0a1fe90.png', 'Revitalize your youth at Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s clinic in Lalitpur, Kathmandu. Explore effective wrinkle treatments.', '<div><!-- primary start -->\r\n\r\n						\n<article>\n\n	<div>\n\n		<img width=\"640\" height=\"229\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/wrinkle-reduction-18c69be1c0a1fe90.png\" alt=\"Wrinkle Reduction\" title=\"Wrinkle Reduction\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/wrinkle-reduction-18c69be1c0a1fe90.png 1024w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/wrinkle-reduction-c9d767b9ff05cf05.png 300w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/wrinkle-reduction-a30fa220a97c3f87.png 768w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/wrinkle-reduction-3b701e40eb2f5345.png 1120w\">\n		<header>\n			<h3>Wrinkle Reduction</h3>		</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n				<div>\n						<section>\n						<div>\n					<div>\n			<div>\n						<div>\n				<div>\n									<div>\n					<div>\n				<div>\n										<div><div></div><div><div></div></div></div>				</div>\n							</div>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				<section>\n						<div>\n					<div>\n			<div>\n						<div>\n				<div>\n									<p>The moment when the first line of aging appear is the best time to visit a skin expert. With current pollution levels and unhealthy diet practices, the world is a challenging place to stay young and healthy.</p><p><b>At our clinic we use the following methods to help you regain that youth and charm:</b></p><p><b>a) Botox treatment</b></p><p><b>b) Ultherapy/ HIFU Wrinkle and Facelift Solution</b></p><p><b>c) Thermage Anti-Aging</b></p><p><b>d) Derma filler Wrinkle Removal</b></p><p><b>e) Radiofrequency Skin Tightening</b></p><p><b>f) Vampire Facial</b></p><p><b>g) Thermage/ Microneedling Radiofrequency</b></p><h2>Get rid of Wrinkles with BOTOX</h2><p>Botox cosmetic uplifts the skin of your face. This is one of the quickest solutions for wrinkles since you will see the result in about 72 hours.</p><p>Basically, you remove your wrinkles by paralyzing your facial skin. When injected in small doses, Botox weakens or contracts the muscles temporarily. Thus, the wrinkles, frown lines, and crow’s feet at the eye corners begin to disappear.</p><p>It also promotes flattening of the skin in 4-6 months. The best time to use Botox is before you start having noticeable wrinkle lines. It can also be used at the first signs of aging or the appearance of wrinkles.</p><h2>Ultherapy/ HIFU Wrinkle and Facelift Solution</h2><p><a href=\"https://akarshanskin.com/our-services/hifu-high-intensity-focused-ultrasound/\">HIFU</a> stands for High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound Device. HIFU is ideal for those looking to avoid needles and surgeries. With this method, you can rather get younger-looking skin without any pain.</p><p>This device is a fast-growing technique for a facelift. This method also makes the jawline visible by removing excess far from the chin area.</p><p>HIFU, when combined with other procedures, can eradicate serious shagging. It also eradicates neck or nape lifting issues. According to popular health information site Healthline.com, HIFU uses ultrasound energy to encourage the production of collagen, which results in firmer skin.</p><p>The visible result takes 3 months to 6 months to appear. Changes are usually felt by the patients.</p><h2>Thermage Anti-Aging</h2><p>Thermage heats the dermis layer of the skin without damaging the epidermis below it. A hand-held device delivers radiofrequency energy into dermal tissue with the help of needles. When the dermal tissue is heated, the collagen fibrils become disrupted, then contract and thicken, tightening the skin layer below the surface.</p><p>As the fibril layers heal, they are reshaped, and new collagen forms. It is comparatively a bit painful procedure. Thus, a numbing cream is applied before starting the procedure. Thermage is probably best for women in their 30s to 40s who have a few wrinkles or mild skin looseness.</p><h2>Derma filler Wrinkle Removal</h2><p>This injectable soft tissue filler is a cosmetic filler to restore fullness and volume in the face. The awkward smile lines in the face or the frowning facial lines in the forehead are filled in to restore a smoother appearance.</p><p>Non-Surgical Dermal fillers can be used to get plumper/fuller lips, soften facial creases, and enhance shallow contours and reduce the visibility of recessed scars and wrinkles. The youthful appearance in the face usually lasts for one to two years as it is gradually absorbed by the skin.</p><h2>Radiofrequency Skin Tightening</h2><p>Aging is a continuous process, and hence many people are seeking noninvasive technologies and treatments to maintain skin health and a lasting youthful appearance.</p><p>Bipolar radiofrequency skin tightening is one of the many options available in our clinic to make your face free of wrinkles and lines. Usually, 6 to 8 settings are needed, each done 2 to 3 days apart. This is a completely painless and pocket-friendly treatment.</p><h2>Vampire Facial</h2><p>Your own blood is used to help promote the healthy activity of your skin cells.</p><p>First, 10 to 20 ml of blood is collected and <a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/our-services/prp-therapy/\">PRP (Platelet Rich Plasma)</a> is separated by centrifuge. The PRP is then applied with the help of micro-needling in the skin. Microneedling makes microscopic injury in the skin which helps in PRP absorption. This method is famously known as celebrity facial. The growth factors present in the plasma of one’s own blood will help in collagen remodeling and get rid of fine lines and wrinkles.</p><p>There are numerous ways to get rid of wrinkles and regain your youthful appearance. Some are simple and cost-efficient while others require some extra effort. It all depends on your needs and preferences.</p><p>At Dr.Rajan Tajhya’s skin laser clinic, we offer free of cost consultation by an expert skin doctor. You can clear your queries and learn more about ways to ensure a healthier skin-life.</p><h2><strong>Wrinkle Removal Price in Lalitpur, Kathmandu, Nepal</strong></h2><p><strong>a) Botox treatment</strong></p><p><strong>Rs. 500 per Unit</strong></p><p><strong>Forehead (20 units) Rs. 10000</strong></p><p><strong>Crows Feet (15-20 units) Rs. (7500 – 10000)</strong></p><p><strong>b) Ultherapy/ HIFU Wrinkle and Facelift Solution</strong></p><p><strong>Upper Face (Forehead) Rs. 2000 (10 Minutes)</strong></p><p><strong>Lower Face (Cheeks) Rs. 15000 (20 Minutes)</strong></p><p><strong>Full Neck Rs. 8000 (45 Minutes)</strong></p><p><strong>Full Face + Neck Rs. 25000</strong></p><p><strong>c) Thermage Anti-Aging</strong></p><p><strong>Rs. 4000</strong></p><p><strong>d) Derma filler Wrinkle Removal</strong></p><p><strong>Rs. 35,000 – Rs. 50,000</strong></p><p><strong>e) Radiofrequency Skin Tightening</strong></p><p><strong>Package for six sessions Rs. 4000</strong></p><p><strong>f) Vampire Facial</strong></p><p><strong>Rs. 6000</strong></p><p><strong>g) Microneedling Radiofrequency </strong></p><p><strong>Per session Rs. 15000</strong></p>								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				</div>\n		\n	</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n	</article><!-- #post-2745 -->\n\r\n					</div>', 'Wrinkle Reduction - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology | Dr. Rajan Tajhya Skin Clinic', 'Revitalize your youth at Dr. Rajan Tajhya’s clinic in Lalitpur, Kathmandu. Explore effective wrinkle treatments.', 0, 1, 25, '2026-10-02 10:55:48', '2026-10-03 11:10:23'),
(12, 'Hydra Facial', 'hydra-facial', 'skin', 'skin', 'services/hydra-facial.png', 'A multi-step facial treatment combining cleansing, exfoliation, extraction, and hydration.', '<p>HydraFacial is a non-invasive facial treatment that combines cleansing, exfoliation, extraction, and hydration. The steps and products can be adapted to the skin and the concerns being addressed.</p><h2>What happens during a session?</h2><p>A visit may include cleansing and exfoliation, gentle suction-assisted extraction, and infusion of hydrating products. Additional steps such as a mask or light-based treatment may be offered depending on the plan.</p><h2>Session length and course</h2><p>The source clinic describes sessions lasting around 45 minutes when additional steps are included. A single session may be enough for some goals, while a series spaced over several weeks may be recommended for others. Your provider can advise after assessing your skin.</p><h2>Pricing</h2><p>Published options range from approximately NPR 2,500 to NPR 7,000 depending on the selected facial and add-ons. Confirm current pricing before booking.</p>', 'Hydra Facial | Aakar Dermatology', 'Learn about Hydra Facial steps, session timing, and options at Aakar Dermatology in Lalitpur.', 0, 1, 6, '2026-10-02 10:55:48', '2026-10-02 10:55:48'),
(13, 'Scar Revision Surgery - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology', 'scar-revision-surgery', 'skin', 'skin', 'services/scar-revision-surgery-f564a97f3cf943a1.png', 'Reduce scars by 80-90% at our Lalitpur clinic. Our expert dermatologist offers quick, effective scar removal starting at Rs. 3,000 per cm.', '<div><!-- primary start -->\r\n\r\n						\n<article>\n\n	<div>\n\n		<img width=\"640\" height=\"229\" src=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/scar-revision-surgery-f564a97f3cf943a1.png\" alt=\"Scar Revision Surgery\" title=\"Scar Revision Surgery\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8000/storage/services/scar-revision-surgery-f564a97f3cf943a1.png 1024w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/scar-revision-surgery-85dad236dbf3dbf3.png 300w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/scar-revision-surgery-7e90c731c6db7ff9.png 768w, http://localhost:8000/storage/services/scar-revision-surgery-0721bb17e3b7e46f.png 1120w\">\n		<header>\n			<h3>Scar Revision Surgery</h3>		</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n				<div>\n						<section>\n						<div>\n					<div>\n			<div>\n						<div>\n				<div>\n									<div>\n					<div>\n				<div>\n										<div><div></div><div><div></div></div></div>				</div>\n							</div>\n				</div>\n								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				<section>\n						<div>\n					<div>\n			<div>\n						<div>\n				<div>\n									<p>For years, scars were seen as permanent things that one carried for eternity. With all the medical advancements of the 21st century, that statement is now partially false.</p><p>A<a href=\"https://drrajanskinclinic.com/\">t our clinic</a>, you can mask your scars under the supervision of a skilled treatment provider. Your scar will be reduced by 80-90% of its original size. This is a very minute surgery and will be completed quickly under the skillful hands of our dermatologist.</p><p>On the other hand, bigger scars may need more attention from the treatment provider. This is why it is crucial to get your treatment only from an experienced dermatologist. </p><h2>Scar Removal/ Revision Price in Lalitpur, Kathmandu, Nepal</h2><p>The cost of <a href=\"https://akarshanskin.com/\">scar reduction/</a> removal depends on the size and depth of the scars. Smaller scars can be removed at a generous package of Rs. 6000 to Rs. 8000 per cm. Meanwhile, removal of relatively bigger scars cost anywhere between Rs. 6000 to Rs. 10000 per cm.</p>								</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n		</div>\n					</div>\n		</section>\n				</div>\n		\n	</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n	</article><!-- #post-2761 -->\n\r\n					</div>', 'Scar Revision Surgery - Dr.Rajan Tajhya | Aakar Dermatology | Dr. Rajan Tajhya Skin Clinic', 'Reduce scars by 80-90% at our Lalitpur clinic. Our expert dermatologist offers quick, effective scar removal starting at Rs. 3,000 per cm.', 0, 1, 27, '2026-10-02 10:55:48', '2026-10-03 11:10:39');
